      "briefing": "One of you is carrying something. You saw it in their face when the Anomaly woke, and now the brood moves when they move. There\u0027s still a chance: a counter-agent can be synthesized in the Med Bay, Hydroponics or the Containment Lab. Make a dose, get close enough, and inject the host. Stay together. The brood is strong, but it can only stun, and only the host can be stopped.",
